WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:15.480
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:15.750 --> 00:18.625
[Lin Zai 002]

3
00:24.458 --> 00:30.874
[Lin Zai 002]

4
00:30.875 --> 00:34.125
[Lin Zai 002]

5
00:56.583 --> 00:58.033
Brother.

6
00:59.042 --> 01:00.584
Sit down.

7
01:06.959 --> 01:09.083
How do you feel this time?

8
01:09.083 --> 01:10.125
Good.

9
01:10.125 --> 01:12.209
Better than last time.

10
01:24.584 --> 01:27.250
Just "better"?

11
01:27.250 --> 01:28.334
What's wrong?

12
01:28.334 --> 01:30.375
Is there a problem?

13
01:31.292 --> 01:32.500
For this batch of blood,

14
01:32.500 --> 01:34.042
I performed separation processing

15
01:34.042 --> 01:36.334
and added targeting enhancers.

16
01:36.334 --> 01:38.334
According to my projections,

17
01:38.334 --> 01:40.917
you should have stayed lucid longer than last time,

18
01:40.917 --> 01:43.626
and the reaction should have been stronger.

19
01:46.625 --> 01:50.084
Maybe it just needs more time.

20
01:52.292 --> 01:54.209
The reactions that should happen, happened.

21
01:54.209 --> 01:56.958
The data doesn't lie.

22
01:56.958 --> 01:59.519
You've only maintained your previous state.

23
02:06.125 --> 02:07.750
That's already very good.

24
02:07.750 --> 02:10.000
Brother... To be honest,

25
02:10.000 --> 02:12.959
I haven't felt like this in a long time.

26
02:20.417 --> 02:22.572
It seems the dosage still isn't enough.

27
02:23.500 --> 02:25.167
What?

28
02:27.583 --> 02:29.125
It's nothing.

29
04:39.083 --> 04:43.542
[Episode 19]

30
04:58.541 --> 05:00.334
The volume required this time will be large.

31
05:00.334 --> 05:01.875
There's loss during the separation process,

32
05:01.875 --> 05:03.584
and extraction efficiency is limited.

33
05:03.584 --> 05:05.103
To maintain the previous effect

34
05:05.103 --> 05:06.683
and keep your brother lucid,

35
05:06.683 --> 05:09.349
we need more blood.

36
05:09.349 --> 05:10.249
I promise,

37
05:10.250 --> 05:12.349
not a single drop of your blood will be wasted.

38
05:12.349 --> 05:13.667
They will be put to full use

39
05:13.667 --> 05:14.958
with the highest efficiency

40
05:14.958 --> 05:17.292
to achieve our goal.

41
05:20.292 --> 05:23.998
Can your body still hold up?

42
05:26.524 --> 05:28.024
Let's do it.

43
06:23.167 --> 06:25.250
[Lin Zai 003]

44
06:28.000 --> 06:31.875
[Lin Zai 003]

45
06:45.083 --> 06:47.208
[Lin Zai 004]

46
06:54.792 --> 06:56.334
Hang in there.

47
07:11.458 --> 07:16.958
[Lin Zai 004] [Lin Zai 005]

48
07:22.459 --> 07:23.959
Here.

49
07:31.084 --> 07:32.125
Slowly.

50
07:32.125 --> 07:33.625
Don't rush.

51
07:43.459 --> 07:45.459
I can handle it.

52
08:14.663 --> 08:16.163
Brother...

53
08:17.834 --> 08:20.084
I can finally save you.

54
08:36.834 --> 08:38.709
Give me one, too.

55
09:03.542 --> 09:05.625
I'm still not quite used to it.

56
09:08.292 --> 09:10.042
There are some things

57
09:10.792 --> 09:12.709
you can never get used to.

58
09:14.000 --> 09:15.625
This...

59
09:16.667 --> 09:18.792
I've just grown accustomed to it.

60
10:12.541 --> 10:13.542
Lin Zai.

61
10:13.542 --> 10:15.959
I've made up my mind. Actually, I...

62
10:19.667 --> 10:21.571
I don't need it.

63
10:31.628 --> 10:33.420
Why do you...

64
10:34.382 --> 10:36.861
smell like He Yao's cigarettes?

65
10:36.861 --> 10:38.986
Did you learn to smoke from him?

66
10:39.660 --> 10:40.917
Yes.

67
10:40.917 --> 10:42.417
I need a cigarette right now.

68
10:42.417 --> 10:44.042
So, the only thing...

69
10:44.042 --> 10:46.250
you don't need right now is me.

70
10:48.625 --> 10:50.875
Are you just realizing that?

71
12:28.750 --> 12:30.458
I don't believe this.

72
12:30.458 --> 12:32.708
Something must have gone wrong.

73
12:35.375 --> 12:36.917
The dosage wasn't enough.

74
12:36.917 --> 12:38.250
Yes.

75
12:38.250 --> 12:40.125
It just wasn't enough.

76
12:49.959 --> 12:52.167
I have to try again.

77
12:57.292 --> 12:58.792
Come on.

78
12:59.750 --> 13:03.584
Lin Zai, I need to be clear about the situation.

79
13:04.417 --> 13:06.834
The antibody's effect is getting clearer,

80
13:06.834 --> 13:07.834
but your brother's body...

81
13:07.834 --> 13:09.959
has already developed drug resistance.

82
13:09.959 --> 13:12.292
We can only suppress his mania for now.

83
13:12.292 --> 13:15.917
His periods of lucidity are getting shorter.

84
13:15.917 --> 13:17.334
For a real breakthrough,

85
13:17.334 --> 13:19.875
we must trigger his own antibody production.

86
13:19.875 --> 13:21.542
This requires massive blood stimulation...

87
13:21.542 --> 13:24.667
to break the drug resistance barrier.

88
13:24.667 --> 13:27.875
However, continuous large-dose blood draws...

89
13:27.875 --> 13:31.042
could lead to severe anemia, hypotension, shock,

90
13:31.042 --> 13:34.042
and even organ damage.

91
13:34.042 --> 13:35.917
So, I suggest...

92
13:37.000 --> 13:38.875
suspending the experiment.

93
13:39.724 --> 13:42.641
We can't stop. We absolutely can't.

94
13:45.792 --> 13:49.000
You know my brother is right there.

95
13:49.000 --> 13:52.025
I can't just stand by when there's hope.

96
13:52.025 --> 13:53.691
I won't be able to live with myself.

97
13:57.902 --> 13:59.167
He Yao.

98
13:59.167 --> 14:00.334
Don't worry.

99
14:00.334 --> 14:02.042
I can handle it.

100
14:07.500 --> 14:09.084
Fine.

101
14:09.084 --> 14:10.792
Follow me.

102
14:16.542 --> 14:18.125
This way.

103
14:27.834 --> 14:29.459
Lie down.

104
14:32.459 --> 14:34.417
We're drawing a lot of blood this time.

105
14:34.417 --> 14:35.500
I'll use a balance solution

106
14:35.500 --> 14:37.459
to help maintain your blood pressure.

107
14:48.334 --> 14:50.084
Are you ready?

108
14:56.334 --> 14:57.959
Let's do it.

109
15:06.993 --> 15:08.292
Guang Qi.

110
15:08.292 --> 15:09.860
I am here.

111
15:09.860 --> 15:11.340
Scorching Sun Report.

112
15:11.340 --> 15:13.625
Immune target lost.

113
15:13.625 --> 15:15.500
Mission failed.

114
15:15.500 --> 15:17.792
Synchronizing database.

115
15:23.026 --> 15:24.334
Updating mission status.

116
15:24.334 --> 15:26.250
Immune target: Lost.

117
15:26.250 --> 15:28.084
Please confirm.

118
15:28.834 --> 15:31.000
Confirmed.

119
15:31.000 --> 15:33.875
Retrieving relevant protocols.

120
15:33.875 --> 15:35.667
Sample Escort Protocol prompt:

121
15:35.667 --> 15:37.750
The immune target is a key strategic resource.

122
15:37.750 --> 15:40.334
Loss will affect R&amp;D progress.

123
15:40.334 --> 15:42.667
Priority search mission recommended.

124
15:42.667 --> 15:44.250
They can't be found.

125
15:44.250 --> 15:46.417
Requesting new mission direction.

126
15:46.417 --> 15:48.750
Synchronizing database.

127
15:49.875 --> 15:51.125
According to mission protocol,

128
15:51.125 --> 15:52.792
after the immune target is lost,

129
15:52.792 --> 15:55.000
the executor should rendezvous at the nearest mission point

130
15:55.000 --> 15:56.167
to complete the handover

131
15:56.167 --> 15:58.459
and receive further instructions.

132
15:58.459 --> 16:00.167
Designated rendezvous coordinates:

133
16:00.167 --> 16:03.959
23.1 degrees North, 113.2 degrees East.

134
16:03.959 --> 16:06.417
Approximately 95 kilometers away.

135
16:06.417 --> 16:08.792
Proceed as soon as possible.

136
16:16.250 --> 16:17.792
Understood.

137
17:41.917 --> 17:45.108
Between us, it's impossible.

138
17:46.459 --> 17:48.825
Everything that happened before...

139
17:48.825 --> 17:51.158
Let's pretend it never happened.

140
17:53.834 --> 17:56.792
Do you know what I need most?

141
17:59.875 --> 18:03.667
If you're in such a hurry, then leave by yourself.

142
18:03.667 --> 18:07.661
So, the only thing you don't need right now is me.

143
18:08.990 --> 18:11.282
Are you just realizing that?

144
18:55.834 --> 18:57.334
Lin Zai!

145
19:39.500 --> 19:41.042
Lin Zai!

146
19:47.625 --> 19:48.834
Have you seen Lin Zai?

147
19:48.834 --> 19:51.084
No. Why?

148
20:06.458 --> 20:08.167
Lin Zai!

149
20:09.084 --> 20:10.792
Lin Zai!

150
20:11.667 --> 20:13.376
Lin Zai!

151
20:15.250 --> 20:16.959
Lin Zai!
